        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maki Nomiya, Conrad Thomas Lant, Cronos\n- Groups: Pizzicato Five\n- Works: Happy End of the World\n- Topics: musicians, band lineup changes, international fame\n\nFacts:\n- Maki Nomiya, born March 12, 1960, is a Japanese singer and musician.\n- Conrad Thomas Lant, born January 15, 1963, is an English musician known by the stage name Cronos.\n- In the late 1980s, Pizzicato Five underwent personnel changes and gained international fame as a duo of Konishi and vocalist Maki Nomiya.\n- Happy End of the World is a 1997 album by Pizzicato Five.",
